WEBVTT

NOTE Timed to the approved narration script; no narration audio exists yet. Re-align to audio when it is recorded.

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.700
Your campus. Your food.
A simpler way to order.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.350
Meet Aarav, Nehru Hall.

3
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:09.050
SETU Food lists approved stalls.
They cook and deliver.

4
00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:11.900
You pay the stall directly.
No commission.

5
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.200
Have an account? Sign in
with your email.

6
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.650
Tap “Email me a one-time code”.

7
00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:20.950
Six digits by email,
and Aarav's in.

8
00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.900
New here? Rewind to Aarav's day one.

9
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.950
Create a User account:
name, email, phone, password.

10
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:30.650
Then four quick steps.

11
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.700
Next: where should orders arrive?
Location access is optional.

12
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.400
Search works too.

13
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.300
Nehru Hall: inside the delivery area.

14
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.750
Check the pin on the map.

15
00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:44.500
Save it as Home, add B-212.

16
00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:50.700
Pick cuisines you like.
They show up first.

17
00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:54.150
Then three things SETU does not do.

18
00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:56.000
Confirm, then “Start ordering”.

19
00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:01.150
New phone, same account:
he picks his saved Home.

20
00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:03.800
Good evening, Aarav.
Tonight: dosa.

21
00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.500
Southside Tiffins: approved by SETU.

22
00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:09.700
Tap ADD: one Masala Dosa,
two filter coffees.

23
00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:13.450
Tap “View cart”:
one stall per order.

24
00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:16.650
Items ₹140, plus the stall's
delivery charge: ₹10.

25
00:01:16.750 --> 00:01:19.450
₹150 to the seller.
No platform fee.

26
00:01:19.650 --> 00:01:23.150
Pay cash at your door,
or online via UPI.

27
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:27.150
After the stall accepts,
one tap opens your UPI app.

28
00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:29.950
Then the stall confirms
the payment.

29
00:01:30.850 --> 00:01:32.950
Aarav picks cash: “Place order”.

30
00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:38.000
Now follow along:
confirmed, cooking, on the way.

31
00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:41.650
At the door, Aarav pays ₹150 in cash.

32
00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:44.850
Then he tells them his code.
Order complete.

33
00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:47.550
Delivered. Five stars
for Southside Tiffins.

34
00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:49.000
Dinner, sorted.

35
00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:50.800
Something off? Tap “Report”.
